# Deploy rulebook for devices
#
# Operators:
#   *  One argument
#   ~  One or more arguments
#
# Parameters:
#   %timeout=...  Command execution timeout (in seconds, 30 by default)
#
# Answers to questions
#
# <command>
#   dialog: <question> ::: <answer> <parameters>
#
# If <question> is enclosed in slashes (//), it is treated as a regexp, otherwise as an exact match.
# Parameters:
#   %send_nl=...  Whether to send a newline after the answer (bool, true by default)
# -----


exit
    dialog: Exit configure exclusive mode? [yes,no] (no) ::: yes %send_nl=1
